    "detailed_description": "A catastrophe has occurred at Safe Side station the A.I, M.I.N.D, has turned against humanity and only a few humans remain. Discover the truth about the downfall of the station and unscrupulous acts of its residents in this atmospheric movement shooter.<br />\r\nUse your glide boots to slide around at high speed and avoid the gunfire of the villainous machines and fight back with your selection of four weapons. Use your grappling hook to traverse the vertical environments and make your way through platforming challenges.<br />\r\nExplore the steampunk retro futuristic space station filled with dark atmosphere and murderous robots.<br />\r\nTry the new noir filter which highlights the German expressionism influence and also play the simulator level with 4 challenge courses.",
    "about_the_game": "A catastrophe has occurred at Safe Side station the A.I, M.I.N.D, has turned against humanity and only a few humans remain. Discover the truth about the downfall of the station and unscrupulous acts of its residents in this atmospheric movement shooter.<br />\r\nUse your glide boots to slide around at high speed and avoid the gunfire of the villainous machines and fight back with your selection of four weapons. Use your grappling hook to traverse the vertical environments and make your way through platforming challenges.<br />\r\nExplore the steampunk retro futuristic space station filled with dark atmosphere and murderous robots.<br />\r\nTry the new noir filter which highlights the German expressionism influence and also play the simulator level with 4 challenge courses.",
